 default-mysql-client | mariadb-client,
 fuse3 | fuse
Description: FUSE filesystem backed by MySQL or MariaDB
 mysqlfs stores filesystem metadata and file contents inside a
 MySQL-compatible database and exposes them through a FUSE mount.
 .
 It includes the mysqlfs filesystem driver, the mysqlfs_setup helper
 used to initialize or upgrade the database schema, and the SQL update
 files required by that setup workflow.
